  "description": "Scan any .NET solution for Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection lifetime problems without changing its project files. DI Scan builds the solution with the DependencyInjection.Lifetime.Analyzers analyzers injected, then reports the rules that fired, where they fired, and the surrounding source, with SARIF, HTML, and Markdown output for false-positive triage and CI.",
